  "description": "<p>Given the <code>head</code> of a linked list, return <em>the list after sorting it in <strong>ascending order</strong></em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/2200d696a1851ea221016ca2df5d71f0d61a39d92e2c2dcca6f2a99069777e29.jpg\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 194px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [4,2,1,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [1,2,3,4]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/49367b04ae63af59f8bf5b40da28e18d4d8f54de4ce64aa55286279808f498c7.jpg\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 184px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [-1,5,3,4,0]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [-1,0,3,4,5]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = []\n<strong>Output:</strong> []\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the list is in the range <code>[0, 5 * 10<sup>4</sup>]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>5</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong> Can you sort the linked list in <code>O(n logn)</code> time and <code>O(1)</code> memory (i.e. constant space)?</p>\n",
  "task": "Solve the 'Sort List' problem on LeetCode.",
  "inputFormat": "Passed directly as parameters.",
  "outputFormat": "Returned value from the solution method.",
  "constraints": [
    "The number of nodes in the list is in the range [0, 5 * 104].",
    "-105 <= Node.val <= 105"
  ],
  "hints": [],
